{"Inefficient string concatenation in a loop when building SQL query for SQLite with large number of IDs - using fmt.Sprintf repeatedly has O(n\u00b2) complexity and causes excessive memory allocations, should use strings.Join or strings.Builder instead": 0.4567320644855499, "Cleanup ticker interval reduced from 10 minutes to 1 minute while the underlying cleanup implementation was changed to a more expensive two-phase batched strategy (SELECT IDs then DELETE by IDs), which significantly increases database load and could cause contention issues in production": 0.7908893823623657}